   "body": "**Operator decision (2026-11-18):**\n- **Q1: (c), not offered.** The topic lists keep Tous / Favoris / Suivis / Lus. No unread-only filter and no flag combinations: REST buckets cover flagged topics only and have no paging, and filtering the loaded page in the app would show near-empty pages. Legacy has none of these, so there is no parity gap.\n- **Q2: covered by #1058** (the « Non lus / Tous » filter on Favoris, merged in #1080). Nothing more is added.\n\nClosed as not planned. #870 (one shared UI for the existing filters) is separate and stays open.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
